@protect_political_wage
title: Enforce binding state arbitration (*Schlichtungswesen*).
subtitle: Use state arbitrators to protect union wages against wage cuts.
view-if: binding_arbitration_enforced == 0
on-arrival: organized_capitalism += 1; binding_arbitration_enforced = 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); labor_strength += 6; labor_dissent -= 4; capital_strike_progress += 1; dvp_relation -= 8; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition
max-visits: 1

Hilferding argued that "the weekly wage is a political wage." By making state wage arbitration legally binding on employers, we protect workers against industrial lockouts and ensure unions remain a key part of the state economy.

@expand_cartel_supervision
title: Empower the Cartel Court to audit corporate account books.
subtitle: Force major industrial syndicates to open their books to public inspection.
view-if: cartel_control == 0
on-arrival: organized_capitalism += 1; cartel_control = 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; dvp_relation -= 8; middle_class_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); inflation -= 0.4
max-visits: 1

We have expanded the authority of the state Cartel Court (*Kartellgericht*). By inspecting corporate account books and penalizing unfair price-fixing on coal, steel, and raw materials, we protect small businesses and lower prices for consumers.

@support_public_enterprises
title: Expand public and municipal enterprises (*Gemeinwirtschaft*).
subtitle: -1 budget - Direct state contracts toward public utilities and trade union co-ops.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: organized_capitalism += 1; budget -= 1; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); economic_growth += 0.2; dvp_relation -= 5
max-visits: 2

Instead of seizing private factories directly, we use government contracts to favor municipal energy suppliers, public transit systems, and trade-union-owned housing cooperatives. This builds a strong public sector that competes directly with private monopolies.

@lower_agricultural_tariffs
title: Lower agricultural tariffs on foreign grain and livestock.
subtitle: Lower food costs for city workers, despite anger from rural landowners.
view-if: agrarian_tariffs_lowered == 0
on-arrival: organized_capitalism += 1; agrarian_tariffs_lowered = 1; workers_spd += 5*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent); inflation -= 0.5; rural_spd -= 3; dnvp_relation -= 12; coalition_dissent += 1 if in_grand_coalition
max-visits: 1

Bread and meat prices are political prices. By cutting tariffs on imported food, we lower the cost of living for city workers—even though wealthy Junker landowners accuse us of betraying German agriculture.

@nationalize_banks_crisis
title: Secure banking supervision and prepare state guarantees.
subtitle: Set up strict oversight over commercial banks to prepare for financial instability.
view-if: bank_control == 0
on-arrival: organized_capitalism += 1; bank_control = 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; dvp_relation -= 6
max-visits: 1

While treaties limit our ability to nationalize major banks during normal times, we institute strict auditing over commercial bank reserves. If a banking crisis occurs, the government will be ready to intervene and protect deposits.
